e verrà in Giappone. Abbastanza sicuramente, Alice appare alla scuola di Shinobu, rivelando che si è trasferita nella sua classe e starà a casa sua.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aP6a2PvANmLXP98aYHQUFG2f41b.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9579","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"16732","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"16732","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78589","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"269872","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"24807","synopsis":"Several weeks after arriving at Shinobu's home, Alice has grown used to life there and is enjoying her high school life in Japan. The mild-mannered and kind Shinobu. The composed but sometimes scatterbrained Aya. The bright and energetic Yoko with her monstrous appetite. Sensitive about her height and shy, Alice managed to make good friends and was spending her days happily, but... Alice begins wondering what her friends think of her and becomes lost deep in thought.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o6d3UHfDL1Dqf6VzklPpdD1TAUw.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Several weeks after arriving at Shinobu's home, Alice has grown used to life there and is enjoying her high school life in Japan. The mild-mannered and kind Shinobu. The composed but sometimes scatterbrained Aya. The bright and energetic Yoko with her monstrous appetite. Sensitive about her height and shy, Alice managed to make good friends and was spending her days happily, but... Alice begins wondering what her friends think of her and becomes lost deep in thought.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o6d3UHfDL1Dqf6VzklPpdD1TAUw.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9579","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"16732","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"16732","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78589","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"269872","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"24805","synopsis":"Perhaps because of Alice's arrival, Shinobu, Aya, and Yoko find themselves noticing foreigners frequently around town. Yoko suddenly announces she met a blonde girl just recently, and an excited Shinobu asks Yoko for more details.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pDqdU6hihACsXgK6RpjOEr6dXHb.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Perhaps because of Alice's arrival, Shinobu, Aya, and Yoko find themselves noticing foreigners frequently around town. Yoko suddenly announces she met a blonde girl just recently, and an excited Shinobu asks Yoko for more details.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pDqdU6hihACsXgK6RpjOEr6dXHb.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9579","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"16732","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"16732","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78589","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"269872","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"24803","synopsis":"Shinobu stays home from school with a cold. While her friends at school are worrying about her, Yoko suddenly runs up and informs the group she found a letter in her shoe box.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zGyRY08Bqq53jqrgX8t8JewZAN4.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"S